@startuml
' AD-024; source ../use-cases/UC-024-browse-community-outfit-inspiration.md
' Draft v0.1, 2026-11-09; approved PR #4 / DD-007 scope, not implementation.
' Trace: FEAT-COM-001; BR-025; CAP-11; PBI-042; US-COM-001 AC.
' SRS: FR-COM-001, FR-COM-002, FR-COM-003, FR-COM-006, FR-COM-007, FR-COM-008, FR-COM-009; DATA-COM-001.
' Business Rules: BRULE-COM-001–003; BRULE-PERS-001; BRULE-AUTH-001/007.
' Open policy: MVP-Q01, MVP-Q02, MVP-Q06, MVP-Q09; PRD Section 34.2. No provider / owner allocation selected.
title AD-024 - Browse and interact with outfit inspiration
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
|User|
start
:Deliberately start UC-024;
|CapsuleAI|
if (Source / affected-user access authorized?) then (Yes)
  :Identify intended source and user context;
else (Denied / unusable)
  :Explain access state; disclose no private data;
  :Offer renewed access or accessible source;
  stop
endif
|CapsuleAI|
:Retrieve attributed shared outfit posts;
if (Retrieval available?) then (Yes)
  if (Posts available?) then (Yes)
    :Show accessible shared looks and creators;
  else (Empty)
    :Show genuine empty-feed state;
    stop
  endif
else (Unavailable)
  :Explain unavailability; offer retry / return;
  stop
endif
|User|
:Select accessible post and a supported action;
|CapsuleAI|
switch (Chosen action?)
case (Like / clear)
  :Apply typed feedback policy (UC-013);
case (Follow creator)
  :Record Follow for identified creator;
case (Save look)
  :Apply approved saved-look policy;
case (Try-On)
  :Hand selected-look basis to UC-028;
case (Share / duplicate entry)
  :Navigate to UC-025 / UC-026;
endswitch
:Show actual accepted state or handoff;
note right
  Community Dislike is neither offered nor accepted.
  Private inventory is not the sharing projection.
  No action alone creates garment ownership or Wear.
end note

stop
@enduml
